meta {
  name: CRUD Flow
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Recommended test order:
  1. Health
  2. Login
  3. Get Me
  4. Logout (optional — invalidates accessToken for later requests)
  5. Create Property (or Bulk Create Properties / npm run seed:properties)
  5. Get Property
  6. Update Property
  7. List Properties
  8. Filter by Status
  9. Delete Property (admin only)
  10. Upload Property Image (requires migration 005_property_images.sql)
  11. List Property Images
  12. Create Property Utility Bill
  13. List Property Utility Bills
  14. Update Property Utility Bill
  15. Delete Property Utility Bill

  Set email and password in the local environment before running.
}
